usya1111/status/1745034074362925368", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kono_hino/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/cab4a72d/uploads/origins/26c1ba39-b931-4e46-be7e-96bc00886103?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fc9721f95ef5aa9fe43efbfeb05db912", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cab4a72d/uploads/origins/26c1ba39-b931-4e46-be7e-96bc00886103?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fc9721f95ef5aa9fe43efbfeb05db912, https://si.imgix.net/cab4a72d/uploads/origins/26c1ba39-b931-4e46-be7e-96bc00886103?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2a3eb6c158ac6cff0f692a258cf60b4a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cab4a72d/uploads/origins/26c1ba39-b931-4e46-be7e-96bc00886103?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=159f5d4518b461744341f8732384c170 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Vの姿の私を描いて頂きたいです…！\n立ち絵は以下になります\nhttps://x.com/saono_hito/status/1464456839320330244/photo/2\n描いて頂いたイラストはXのポストやサムネイル、\n配信画面など金銭のやりとりを含まないものに使わせて頂きたいと思っています\nよろしくお願いします", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kono_hino/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/52a1ecfe/uploads/origins/84fce48f-3873-4888-9ea8-0c73b4ba0217?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=05c786419f8816049cef6d5f15ce584e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/52a1ecfe/uploads/origins/84fce48f-3873-4888-9ea8-0c73b4ba0217?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=05c786419f8816049cef6d5f15ce584e, https://si.imgix.net/52a1ecfe/uploads/origins/84fce48f-3873-4888-9ea8-0c73b4ba0217?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=56e391c16b360b3470275c2e6c7169d7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/52a1ecfe/uploads/origins/84fce48f-3873-4888-9ea8-0c73b4ba0217?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d2a013a1c